cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Scientific Toolkit MCP: an allowlisted MCP gateway for scientific CLIs"
abstract: >-
  A single MCP server that exposes a fixed catalog of scientific CLIs behind
  validated adapters. Every call runs an allowlisted console script or module
  with explicit input and output limits, a bounded execution timeout, and the
  upstream return code preserved in the response. The gateway ships local
  stdio and authenticated HTTP transports and never evaluates arbitrary
  commands or Python code.
